From 91d775856ec60ba6a9589871decf6e64f4721502 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A U Thor <author@example.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:01:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Detect binary files earlier

Binary files are now detected before the name is read.
index entries keep their mode.
new file mode bits are preserved.
similarity index is no longer rounded.

Signed-off-by: A U Thor <author@example.com>
---
 reader.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/reader.c b/reader.c
index fff6310..85ea706 100644
--- a/reader.c
+++ b/reader.c
@@ -1 +1,2 @@
+int read_header(void);
 int read(void);
